    "text": "If for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the feet of perpendiculars from the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> respectively, then the length of line segment&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> is equal to :",
